# Build context hygiene (C8). The production image must contain no environment file, no legacy archive,
# no test fixtures and no local state — CI asserts this on every build.
node_modules
**/node_modules
.next
**/.next
.turbo
**/.turbo
.git
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Never in an image: the preserved legacy archive (read-only reference, redacted but private — ADR-027).
legacy-reference

# Tests, fixtures and local tooling have no place in a runtime image.
**/test
**/e2e
**/*.test.ts
**/*.spec.ts
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/fixtures
docs
spike
tools/design-bundle
**/design/ds-bundle*
**/design/packs
**/handoff
media
*.log
*.zip
*.tgz
